{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:872185030745bf72","name":"Cargo Pod","source":{"id":"source:reference-872185030745bf72","title":"Cargo Pod","revision":24994,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:53:59Z","sha256":"4dfb73b898307818c103fb8f447080b0cc4615379be0cb7c4d247c7e66bb36fd","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24994","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Cargo%20Pod&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-872185030745bf72","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CARGO POD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EP\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SIZE RESTRICTION\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Light\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Gargantuan or Larger\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["500 (Base)\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Medium\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal or Larger\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,000 (Base)\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Heavy\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Colossal (Frigate) or Larger\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1,500 (Base)\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Cargo Pods are additional storage space added to a ship to boost its total carrying capacity. Though they allow independent traders to carry more goods, they also reduce a ship's ability to maneuver quickly, making them unpopular with pirates and military craft. Each Cargo Pod added to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," reduces its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," score by 2. You can add multiple Cargo Pods to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},", but cannot add a Cargo Pod if it would drop the Starship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," below 1.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The additional carrying capacity is based on the size of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},". A Small Cargo Pod adds ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"}," x 1 tons of cargo. A Medium Cargo Pod adds ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"}," x 5 tons of cargo. A Large Cargo Pod adds ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"}," x 10 tons of cargo.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Cargo Pod can be made detachable (to act as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Escape Pod"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Escape_Pod","referenceId":"reference:a257ab4a352c2042"},") for five times the cost.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Can you gain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"}," by converting the cargo space provided by a Cargo Pod?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," No. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," can only convert its own internal cargo space into ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Points"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
